{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_046_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_046_1000_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7c206fcc09caa2f9826e165a3a9031fc615efe81d6aaf7037290e5edc915c29d", "ja": "先日、美味しい甘味処を見つけ\nたのです。よろしければ今度、\nみなさんもご一緒にいかがですか？", "zh": "我前几天发现一间美味的日式甜点店。\n各位若是不嫌弃，\n下次要不要一起去呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_046_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "3dd2ef2c163f414525e5f620f07601744cd935a6bbdf91f942b003df599be9be", "ja": "なんと……それは是非とも。\n{$P$}も誘って、\n皆で参りましょう。", "zh": "哎呀……小女子非常乐意。\n也邀请{$P$}，\n大家一起去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_046_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "e6cfe3096a639352aa468c34531a9a609ee44e51c185862e8df41229667d939b", "ja": "ちょうどいいわね。今度、\n出張で遠くへ行くそうだから……\nその前に、応援の意味でも。", "zh": "这样正好，\n听说他最近要去很远的地方出差……\n就当成是祝他出差顺利的聚会吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_046_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cbd3f44c0024b9283f287759fe9045b76ab765164e6b42c853754673c10ad5e6", "ja": "え？　遠くへ……出張？\n{$P$}が？\nあの、それは本当なのですか？", "zh": "咦？去很远的地方……出差？\n{$P$}吗？\n那个，这是真的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_046_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "22b1042e084f341ea07aadf32d98ee6171856b4cacba9dd58a3dd797e52564d9", "ja": "あ、紬ちゃん、まだ聞いて\nいなかったのね。そうみたいなの。\n劇場も寂しくなるわね……。", "zh": "啊，小䌷还没听说这件事啊。\n似乎是真的喔。\n剧场也要变冷清了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
